  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-10-evening-owl-text-10",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-10T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "防風罩的三種固定，先分清楚再用。\n推車：用白夾扣或彈性束帶，固定在合適的位置。\n揹巾：沿肩帶扣住上緣，揹巾本身照樣承托。\n下擺：按釦扣成兩個褲管，再確認腿腳能活動，布料遠離輪子與關節；無論哪一種，都露出臉和口鼻，也不取代原有安全帶。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "published",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00",
    "run_id": "42820460529",
    "container_id": "17966102859228916",
    "published_id": "18083115968422426",
    "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@lovehibou/post/Dfj9n8NEfO5",
    "published_at": "2026-11-10T20:59:59+08:00",
    "error": null,
    "reply_id": "18090474101701825"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-11-noon-owl-ep02-s2",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-11T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "風大的日子，也想帶你慢慢走。\n不必趕路，也不用把小被子一路追著跑。\n先照推車或揹巾的說明扣上，不要拆掉原本的固定。\n路上看：臉露出來、口鼻沒被蓋住、扣子有沒有鬆。熱了就打開。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-windshield?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "skipped",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00",
    "note": "missed window",
    "run_id": "43018129999"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-12-evening-owl-ep02-s3",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-12T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "從出門到回家，唸的都是這幾句。\n有沒有冷？會不會熱？臉有沒有露出來？\n口鼻別被布蓋住，安全帶照扣，下擺別靠近輪子和關節。\n存起來，下次出門再對一次。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s3.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "published",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00",
    "run_id": "43225692853",
    "container_id": "17966430456228916",
    "published_id": "17866113015696477",
    "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@lovehibou/post/DfpJIFLiQR6",
    "published_at": "2026-11-12T21:17:01+08:00",
    "error": null,
    "reply_id": "17898839178612671"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-13-noon-owl-text-12",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-14T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "六重紗，不是越厚越好。\n看季節、室溫、怎麼用，也看孩子會不會出汗。\n「六重」是布料結構，不是保暖分數；別只數層數，厚薄和用途一起看。\n先選用得到的，再選花色。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-14-noon-owl-ep01-s1",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-14T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "風一吹，小被子又想溜走。\n一手推車、一手撿被子，還要看寶寶會不會著涼。\n把防風罩扣在推車上，布就不會一路被風帶走；臉和口鼻留在外面。\n你也有過一路追著小被子的時刻嗎？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep01_s1.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-15-evening-owl-ep01-s2",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-15T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "帶寶寶出門，天氣總有自己的想法。\n早上有風，午後也許又暖了起來；進到室內，還要再看看這一層需不需要。\n需要時再加上，覺得熱了就打開或取下，臉和口鼻隨時露出來。\n你今天也幫寶寶調整了幾次衣服？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep01_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-windshield?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-16-bedtime-owl-ep01-s3",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-16T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "當爸媽之後，睡前多做這幾件。\n小手有沒有放好，房間會不會太熱。\n坐下了還是會再瞄一眼，看他是不是真的睡著。\n今天也辛苦了。去睡吧。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep01_s3.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-16-noon-gift-shipping",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-16T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "朋友家添了寶寶，禮物想直接寄過去。\n可以寄到朋友家，也可以寄到月子中心，不用先轉寄一次。\n結帳時勾選「這是送禮，寄給別人」，收件欄填收禮人的姓名、手機和地址；寄月子中心，備註再寫中心名稱、媽媽的姓名、房號和收件時間。\n祝福卡也可以把想說的話寫上。建議選宅配到府，超商取貨付款要由收禮人付款。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-17-evening-sweat-pad",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-17T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "跑跳、玩積木，一忙起來就流汗。\n把替換巾從後領放入，攤平在衣服和背部之間，小領片翻在衣領外；濕了就抽出來，換一條乾淨的。\n請在孩子清醒、由大人看顧時使用，睡覺前取下，布巾不要遮住口鼻，也不留在嬰兒睡眠空間。\n不放背後時，也可以拿來擦汗，或墊在大人肩上拍嗝；背部、擦嘴和拍嗝，請分開用乾淨的布巾。\n現售花色有粉色自由鳥，其他款式請看選購區。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-sweat-pad?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-18-noon-journal-yilan",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-18T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "那趟宜蘭的雨，沒有把行程整段取消。\n蠟筆城堡裡畫彩色筆，晚上回到蘭城晶英，還有小車和房內帳篷可以玩。\n雨天帶小孩出門，本來就會慢一些；能進到室內、再走一段，也就夠了。\n這篇遊記還在喜福生活誌裡，想翻照片的時候可以看。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/journals/hibou-travel-yilan?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-19-evening-swaddle-towel",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-19T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "一條方巾，包著、擦著、蓋著。\n約 70 公分見方，一面是紗布，一面是圈圈毛巾布。包的時候毛巾面朝裡，腿要留可以彎、可以張開的空間，布不要蓋到口鼻。\n寶寶開始會翻身、或常常想掙脫時，就不要再包，改當浴巾，或推車上的小蓋毯。\n擦乾、換好衣服以後就收起來，不要留在嬰兒睡眠空間。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-swaddle-towel?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-20-noon-gauze-washing",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "洗澡台邊一條、擦嘴一條，外出包再留乾淨的備品。\n紗布巾先分好用途，用過的和乾淨的分開放，不要把沾濕的布折回乾淨那一格。\n第一次用以前，先依洗標洗過、晾乾；能不能機洗、要不要洗衣袋，都看那一件的說明。\n洗完整條乾透再收。包邊鬆了、或洗完還有異味，先停用，問我們就好。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-gauze-washing?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-21-evening-owl-ep03-s2",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-21T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "一句「辛苦了」，也是一份彌月祝福。\n寶寶來了，半夜要起床的人多了一個。\n禮物不必只買給寶寶。卡片寫給他們：這陣子誰在熬夜、誰在換尿布。\n蘋安彌月禮盒可以加祝福卡，下單時把話寫進去。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep03_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-22-noon-giftbox-choice",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-22T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "送彌月禮，不必先決定要哪一盒。\n可以先問：家裡還缺什麼？有衣服或防踢被，再問身高和現在的尺寸；想繡名字，先把寫法問清楚。\n官網上有蘋安彌月禮盒、神隊友滿月彌月禮盒，還有新生彌月日式連身褲禮盒，三款內容不一樣，分開看就好。\n先選用得到的，再看好花色。\n有送禮日的話，先用 LINE 問我們。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-23-evening-owl-ep02-s1",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-23T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "天氣轉涼，出門前多做一個小檢查。\n先固定，再整理下擺，最後看看寶寶的臉。\n防風罩不能取代推車安全帶，也不能遮住口鼻；下擺還要避開輪子與關節。\n你家出門前，一定會檢查哪一件事？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s1.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "帶娃出門崩潰日記",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-24-noon-winter-warmth",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-24T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "防風和保暖，其實不是同一件事。\n風大的時候，就算氣溫沒那麼低，直吹也會覺得冷；進到室內、天氣回暖，這一層也許就不需要了。\n防風罩減少風吹在身上，它本身不是厚的保暖層；覺得熱了、寶寶出汗了，就打開或取下。臉和口鼻要露出來，外出時大人在旁邊看顧。\n表布防潑水，也不等於雨具。下雨還是先找地方避雨。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/guides/stroller-winter-warmth?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-25-evening-bib-round",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-25T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "衣領一下就濕了，外出包再放一條乾淨的圍兜。\n６重紗圓形圍兜用按扣圍在胸前，下擺是一片圓弧；沾濕時就能替換，衣服濕了也要一起換。\n由大人協助扣合，扣好後看頸部鬆緊，布不要堆到口鼻旁；睡覺前取下。\n單入販售，現售花色請看選購區。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-bib-round?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-26-noon-owl-ep03-s3",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-26T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "禮盒一打開，大家各看各的。\n有人看花色，有人研究紗布巾，有人急著唸卡片。\n花色可以等，卡片上那幾句先唸完。\n你收過哪一句彌月祝福，到現在還記得？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep03_s3.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/guides/baby-gift-budget-timing?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-27-evening-owl-ep02-s2",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-27T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "風大的日子，也想帶你慢慢走。\n不必趕路，也不用把小被子一路追著跑。\n先照推車或揹巾的說明扣上，不要拆掉原本的固定。\n路上看：臉露出來、口鼻沒被蓋住、扣子有沒有鬆。熱了就打開。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-windshield?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-28-noon-outing-bag",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-28T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "鞋子穿好了，才想起還少放一條巾子。\n出門前先想今天幾點回家，再把包包分成四區：換尿布、乾淨替換、餵食、待洗。家人接手時，也比較找得到。\n一般布巾和防風罩不能代替專用的換尿布墊；奶嘴夾只在清醒、大人看顧時用，不繞頸，睡覺前取下。\n用過幾次，你會更清楚自己家最常拿的是哪一袋。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "帶娃出門崩潰日記",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-outing-bag-checklist?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-29-evening-journal-hub",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-29T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "有時候想看出門的照片，有時候想先看用品怎麼用。\n喜福生活誌把親子遊記、育兒文章和使用分享放在一起，可以從現在想看的主題開始。\n最近也整理了出生登記、生育補助和產假這幾件新手爸媽常查的事，窗口和要帶的文件都依官方資料寫好了。\n想慢慢翻的話，從這裡進就好。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/journals/hibou-journal?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "新手媽媽",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-30-noon-dress-warm",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-30T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "手腳冰冰的，不一定代表冷。\n摸後頸比摸手腳準一點：溫溫的就是剛好，出汗了就減一件。\n穿幾件沒有標準答案。捷運上、賣場裡、走回家的那段路，溫度都不一樣，能脫能穿比一次穿好穿滿實用。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/baby-dress-warm-or-hot?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-01-evening-embroidery",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-01T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "繡名字最常卡住的，其實不是花色，是寫法。\n小名還是大名、要不要加姓、中文還是英文，英文的大小寫也要確認，Emma 跟 EMMA 繡出來就是兩回事。\n如果名字還沒定案，可以送不繡字的版本，或直接問對方名字取好了沒。\n拿不定主意，或有送禮日的話，先用 LINE 問我們。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/baby-name-embroidery?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-02-noon-hanky",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-02T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "六重紗萬用小手帕，攤開約 25×25cm（±1cm）。\n餵奶後擦嘴、公園玩完擦汗、吃飽擦手，都是同一條在用。帶去幼兒園也可以。\n搭手帕夾可以固定在隨手拿得到的位置，夾子另售；織帶不要繞過頸部。\n出門時乾淨的跟用過的分開放，回家再洗、晾乾。\n花色有蘋果、小鷹、木馬這些。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-hanky?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-03-evening-library-card",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-03T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "有爸媽問：聽說辦借書證會拿到閱讀禮袋？\n這是各縣市鄉鎮圖書館在做的，條件、年齡、內容都看各縣市，多半要設籍，常在辦借書證的時候一起領。\n不一定每個地方都有，也不一定人人領得到。先查自己這個縣市怎麼規定，再跑一趟。\n我們把各地的做法整理在這裡。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/baby-library-card-reading-bag?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-04-noon-peace-bag",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-04T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "長輩準備的平安符，放口袋容易掉，直接別在衣服上又怕勾到。\n蘋安福袋是蘋果造型，取「平安」的諧音，尺寸合適的平安符可以收進去，袋口用按扣開合，夾扣扣在衣物上。\n出門前大人先確認袋口和夾扣都扣好，使用時在旁邊看著，休息或睡覺前取下來。夾扣、按扣或縫線壞了就先別用；要清潔前，記得把裡面的東西拿出來。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-apple-peace-bag?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-05-evening-corporate-gifts",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-05T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "公司要送同事彌月禮，順序大概是這樣：\n先把名單對一次，有幾位、各自寶寶多大；再問寄到哪，寄家裡還是月子中心，收件人和電話要齊；最後才挑款式。\n要繡名字的話，把寫法先問清楚，不要用猜的。\n有送禮日的話，先用 LINE 問我們。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/corporate-baby-gifts?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-06-noon-swaddle-stop",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-06T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "包巾不是包得越緊越好。\n腿的地方要留空間，能彎、能張開；布不要蓋到口鼻。\n什麼時候停？寶寶開始會翻身，或常常自己掙扎想掙脫，就別再包了。\n洗完澡擦乾、衣服換好之後，包巾就收起來，不要留在嬰兒睡眠空間裡。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/swaddle-how-to-and-when-to-stop?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-07-evening-belly",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-07T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "六重紗嬰兒肚圍，從側邊打開黏扣帶，依衣服厚薄調整鬆緊。\n換好衣服後想在腹部多一層包覆，就把它攤開、繞過腰腹，再把黏扣帶貼合。\n選尺寸先量腰圍，對照商品頁的尺寸表，不要只看年齡；每個孩子體型差很多。\n穿好之後留意一下衣服厚度和孩子的狀況，看起來悶或不舒服就調鬆、取下。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-belly?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-08-noon-daycare",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-08T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "托嬰中心第一週要帶什麼，不用先上網抄。\n先拿到中心給的物品通知和姓名標示規定，那張才是標準。網路上的建議跟通知不一樣時，以通知為準。\n不確定就問老師一句，比買錯一堆省事。\n我們整理了第一週的準備方向，可以配著那張通知看。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/infant-daycare-first-week?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-09-evening-flashcards",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-09T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "黑白卡不用排課表。\n挑寶寶清醒、吃飽、心情平穩的時候，由大人拿一張給他看。\n一次幾分鐘就好。寶寶轉開頭、揉眼睛，或是開始哼哼，就代表夠了，收起來換別的事。\n它就是一張卡片，陪玩的一種。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/black-white-cards-newborn?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-10-noon-hooks",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-10T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "重的包袋不要掛在推車把手上，可能讓推車向後翻覆。\n萬用金屬置物勾 2 入組，織帶繞過固定點、穿環、反折，再把魔鬼氈貼合。它是收納配件，不是安全扣，也不是承重吊具。\n掛水壺、濕紙巾、小包這類輕的東西可以；重的包袋請放原廠置物籃，也先看推車說明允不允許加掛配件。\n掛勾是開放式的，推車晃動或被拉到，東西還是可能滑落。不要用來吊掛或牽引人體，也別裝在嬰兒床裡或孩子搆得到的地方。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-stroller-hooks?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-12-evening-carrier-wind",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "用揹巾出門想多一層擋風，順序不要顛倒。\n先照揹巾本身的說明把孩子固定好，原本的固定一個都不要拆，再把防風罩加在外側。防風罩不能取代安全帶。\n路上停下來時順手看三件事：臉有沒有露出來、口鼻有沒有被蓋到、扣子有沒有鬆。\n走一走覺得熱、背上出汗了，就打開或取下，全程由大人看顧。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261130_1220",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-14T18:12:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-12-13-noon-parental-leave",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-12-13T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "115 年 1 月 1 日起，受僱勞工在子女滿 3 歲前，原本最長 2 年的育嬰留停裡，有 30 日可以視需要以「日」為單位向公司申請。\n對剛入托要陪適應、要帶去看診，或家裡臨時缺人手的時候，比較好安排。\n實際怎麼申請、公司怎麼配合，還是要看官方與勞保局的說明，我們整理在這篇。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/guides/parental-leave-allowance-2026?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_dec_20261130",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
